<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Billing Notice</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Google Sans', Roboto, Segoe UI, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #3c4043;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dadce0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.30), 0 1px 3px 1px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
        }
        .logo {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            width: 125px;
            height: auto;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #202124;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 32px;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 21px;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
        }
        .detail-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 16px 0 24px;
        }
        .detail-table td {
            padding: 8px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 21px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f3f4;
        }
        .detail-table td:first-child {
            color: #70757a;
            width: 45%;
        }
        .detail-table td:last-child {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #202124;
        }
        .button-container {
            margin: 32px 0;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: #1a73e8;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 32px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #70757a;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #dadce0;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://timemoz.com/logo.png" alt="Timemoz Logo" class="logo">

            <h1>Billing Notice</h1>

            <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
            <p>This is a reminder that you have an <strong>active invoice</strong> for your Timemoz subscription with the following details:</p>

            <table class="detail-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>Invoice Number</td>
                    <td>{{invoiceNumber}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Plan</td>
                    <td>{{tierName}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Subscription Period</td>
                    <td>{{period}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Total Amount</td>
                    <td>{{totalPrice}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Due Date</td>
                    <td>{{expiredAt}}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <p>Please complete your payment before the due date to avoid service deactivation.</p>

            <div class="button-container">
                <a href="{{paymentUrl}}" class="button">Pay Now</a>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <p>If you have already completed your payment, please disregard this email.</p>

            <p>Best regards,<br><strong>Timemoz Team</strong></p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">Jl. Mampang Prapatan Raya no 17c, Mampang Prapatan, Jakarta Selatan, Indonesia, 12790</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">&copy; 2026 Timemoz, Jakarta, Indonesia</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
